          "why_it_matters": "This is the core Parks-Street-Hart conversation, not a generic leader date. The trio has its own recorded language on Find the Way, and Parks' 2023 Vanguard week with Street and Hart was the moment that pushed him to expand the group for the project that became By All Means. Bringing the original three back to the same room puts the focus again on the trio's elastic center: Parks' open harmony, Street's quiet gravitational pull and Hart's unmistakably floating authority at the drums.",
